{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>PhysicPro 是一款專為 5 至 12 年級學生設計的完整物理助手，也適合任何希望在同一個地方獲得清晰、有條理的物理內容的人。它集合超過 300 條公式、逐步例題與內建計算器，原價 US $1.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>一站式物理學習工具</h2>\n<p>PhysicPro 收錄 300 多個物理公式，分為力學、熱力學、電學、磁學、光學、波動與聲學、流體力學、核物理、相對論、量子物理及常數等 11 個類別。每個公式均附清晰講解、逐步例題與內建計算器，另有 27 個互動圖表、10 種單位換算、120 道測驗題及 200 個術語詞典，方便備考、做功課與複習核心概念。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-434-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-435-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-436-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-437-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-438-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-439-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：PhysicPro by EtemiDev</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T15:24:44.701006+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":334,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}